Output docs/assets/wattari-gattari-demo.gif

Require node

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Type "npm run demo:tui"
Enter
Wait+Screen /direct approval/
Sleep 2s

Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Wait+Screen /message this Codex session/
Sleep 2s

Type "검증 결과를 요약해줘"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Wait+Screen /결과와 검증 근거/
Sleep 2s

Left
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+C
